{"title":"*The School of Night*","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/945450671/0/marginalrevolution~The-School-of-Night.html","date":1770541436000,"content":"<p>That is the new Knausgaard book, excellent and moving.  Better than any Knausgaard work other than the first two volumes of <em>My Struggle</em>.  The ending is especially good and meaningful, revising much of what came before.  You can buy it <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/School-Night-Karl-Ove-Knausgaard/dp/0593832809/ref=sr_1_1?crid=KAYR8C64Z5BC&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.RCQTfaHvbqqiCimh3Q_7xLWV5pAD45edKlQUbOjox9533tKBcOQNmpF-O43veUAq26e52uJSfNfnY9H2InAXfzAu1onHNlxZkJXyTCMELtK5c75ETxyIlpkPciS6Xhka-1NMxMlOli-BNTePUVmgow.NuH96INIHQ3w8dHSJo4osUm4q3IkMHhBdjUxiWmk6D0&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=school+of+night+knausgaard&amp;qid=1770519852&amp;sprefix=school+of+night%2Caps%2C151&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/02/the-school-of-night.html\">*The School of Night*</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/945450671/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/945450671/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/945450671/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/945450671/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/945450671/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /><